{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19214","headline":"酬窦员外郡斋宴客偶命柘枝因见寄兼呈张十一院长元九侍御 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬窦员外郡斋宴客偶命柘枝因见寄兼呈张十一院长元九侍御","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"分忧余刃又从公，白羽胡牀啸咏中。\n彩笔谕戎矜倚马，华堂留客看惊鸿。\n渚宫油幕方高步，澧浦甘棠有几丛。\n若问骚人何处所，门临寒水落江枫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19214.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19214","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}